# One rectangle of a block face: normal along axis a (sign s) on grid plane `plane`, spanning w x h cells from (p, q) on
# axes u, v.
static func _quad(soup: PackedVector3Array, org: Vector3, size: Vector3, a: int, u: int, v: int, s: int, plane: int,
